  - Codex
  - Gemini
  - pre-registration
  - empirical software engineering
abstract: >-
  A pre-registered experiment with 1,187 recorded runs of Claude Code, Codex and Gemini (Antigravity CLI) on a
  fictional retailer's four repos. Two tickets ask the agent to rename or remove an event field that other teams
  read. It measures how often the agent breaks another team (by that team's own tests), with no rule, with the rule
  in the agent's spec, or with every repo visible, and whether a consumer-contract check in CI stops the break.
